# Used at build time. Copy to .env for a local production build.
# Leave unset during `npm run dev` so the site is served at /.

# Public site origin, no trailing slash.
SITE_URL=https://the-well-aog.github.io

# Project-site prefix. Use / for a custom domain or a user site.
BASE_PATH=/site-development

# Content source. Set to read sermons, events, ministries, leaders, and announcements from
# Strapi; leave unset to use the Markdown in src/content. If set and unreachable, the build fails.
# STRAPI_URL=https://cms.wellspringstudiollc.com
# Public origin for uploaded images, when the build reaches Strapi on a private address.
# STRAPI_PUBLIC_URL=https://cms.wellspringstudiollc.com

# Optional overrides for src/data/site.ts. Neither needs an API key.
# FACEBOOK_PAGE=https://www.facebook.com/yourpage
# YOUTUBE_CHANNEL=@yourchannel
